      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Hipnose. Drowzee se lembra de todos os sonhos que devora. Raramente come os sonhos de adultos, pois os das crianças são muito mais saborosos. Ao mexer o nariz, consegue descobrir onde uma pessoa está dormindo e com o que ela está sonhando.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Drowzee pode evoluir para Hypno no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Hypnosis, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Poison Gas</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Meditate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Wake-Up Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Synchronoise</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Psychic, Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Nasty Plot, Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Calm Mind, Confide, Curse, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Double-Edge, Drain Punch, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Grass Knot, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Imprison, Knock Off, Light Screen, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Metronome, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Assist, Barrier, Fire Punch, Flatter, Guard Swap, Ice Punch, Nasty Plot, Power Split, Psychic Terrain, Psycho Cut, Role Play, Secret Power, Skill Swap, Thunder Punch</p>",
